Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pakistan's industrial and financial\Ncenter located in the Indus River Delta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it out with vision to turn around.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.86,0:01:55.99,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,642)\pos(192,815)}Episode 16: The Lovers, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, a Donner Kebab joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop and get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Donner Kebab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been called the\Nhamburger of the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A slab of meat is placed on a spit,\Nits outer layer roasting as it turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before long, the meat is cooked,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sliced, and served with any\Nnumber of sides and condiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like five of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be a thousand yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousand yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the Middle East,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.35,0:02:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japanese and Western business\Npractices are by no means universal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Namely, prices change and\Nare open to negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no understanding of how to\Nhaggle or how to value goods for sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first-time visitors can become\Neasy targets for exploitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here, people don't see such\Nexploitation as a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swindled are deserving of\Nthe label fool, not victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haggling takes guts and ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first step is the art of the bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it clear you see through the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him know you're no slouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far too much for\Na handful of kebabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hearty laugh always helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, how much would you buy him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The merchant will test the waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it 250 yen for five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In return, you throw out a price so low?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't help but blush and then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll act as if you have no\Nsense at all, catching on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I sold them for that cheap,\NI'd be out on the streets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my wife and seven children\Nwould starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he'll gesture the old throat slash,\Nbut you can't give up the fight just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.59,0:03:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe I'll just\Nbuy them somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretend that you're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, friend, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very much like foreigners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sell you five for 700 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll try to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then make it 300!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the haggling begin! 600!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,350! 550!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,400! 450!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,425! I'll take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I got them for less than\Nhalf his original price. Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm made out like a bandit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and just as you think you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I usually sell five for 150\Nyen. Bye-bye. Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap! Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old lady's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't said anything\Nto any of them, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I would actually tell\Nthem the secret of Lord Dio's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am and shall always\Nbe his loyal servant!
