Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross! What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of worms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have done nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you come here to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio places his trust in no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even you and Yabba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's my job to make sure\Nthat you never speak again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the rest of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way you're leaving is in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dan of Steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand represents the\None and only Lover's Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will see to it that you all meet the\Nsame fate as that pathetic witch Iniyaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old lady was one of your\Nown, you son of a... Memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.73,0:06:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are all lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio would never do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am his loyal servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loyal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things coming out of her body,\Nthey're definitely not some stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're actual tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have dedicated everything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio would never do me such harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd never plant a flesh bud in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio is my only reason for living.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We trust each other wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun just disintegrated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flesh bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made out of Dio's own cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say you were\Nquite the perceptive one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're so astute, I'll continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what a full-grown\Nflesh bud looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to kill her, not control her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I just grew it inside the old bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yarba,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may be the very one who told lord\Ndio about the stance but you're a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fool to think that a man with such\Ncomplete power would ever trust a feeble
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,old woman like you unfortunately\Nit's a point you fail to realize old
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lady what's the true identity of dio
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stan tell us you placed all your hope
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in dio you trusted him with your\Nlife and your sons and now after all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:08:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've sacrificed you know he's not\Nthe man you thought he was you know i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right we must defeat dio no matter\Nthe cost you have to tell us we need
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to know tell us what we need to know\Nabout dio's stand before it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He believes in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i'll serve him even in\Ndeath i won't betray him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's laughable how sad that old woman was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the very depth of her trust\Nin him should tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio's evil charm is more\Npowerful than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old woman may have had it out for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she was misled and\Nsure as hell didn't deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four against one, but we won't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to act cool\Nand get up and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going down whether\Nyou want it or not. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Dan of
