Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steel and none of you can take me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What What happened, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew back just like that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an utter fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:10:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to explain my\Npowers when you hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That impatience nearly\Nkilled your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you listen next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have other important\Nbusiness to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.39,0:10:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think I would show my\Nface here just to kill in Yaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told us that your stand is\Nthe lover's, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point in telling you\Nnow the battle's already begun, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.57,0:10:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all simple. tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know no matter how hard you\Nlook, you won't be able to see my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid. Half-Pine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours if he can hit\Nme in the leg with that broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell? Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I broke my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you still haven't figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand can't be seen because\Nit's rooted firmly inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment Enya died, it entered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got to your brain through your\Near, and that's how I'll get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand and I are\Nconnected, just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my stand gets hurt, so do I,\Nand the reverse is also true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're utterly helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as scratch me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in that instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stand will react to\Nmy pain by going berserk
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in your head and inflicting\Nthe same agony on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, it will deliver\Na pain several times greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll say it once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone or together, you won't be\Nable to lay a single finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, the Lovers has taken one of\NLord Dio's flesh buds into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's growing in your brain as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like it did to Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll devour you from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall asking you to strike\Nme again, you stupid little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be honest, my stand of lovers\Nisn't as strong as you might think it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have the strength to\Nmove even a single strand of hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it the world's weakest stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, power isn't necessary if all\Nyou want to do is kill your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, gentlemen?
