Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something unfortunate happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I get into an accident, a baseball\Nhits me, or I just trip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think that would\Naffect you, Mr. Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might get banged up some, but your body\Nwould suffer far greater pain than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I feeling your knuckles\Ncracking in my prosthetic hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got ten minutes, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then your brain will be eaten through\Nand you'll be a corpse like in Yabba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.21,0:13:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill this damn tool so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't have enough time to feel pain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me before I feel it,\Nhuh? Sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what were you planning to strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me my face or maybe my throat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down on me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try busting\Na hole through my chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or how about you give up on using your\Nstand and crack my head open with a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one looks like a prime specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure looks big enough for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do not want to\Nunderestimate me, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say I'm gonna\Ndo something, I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already seen how\Neffective his power is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill\Nyour own grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, this is Jotaro we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumb good-for-nothing punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you toy with me, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the geezer kicks\Nthe bucket, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be your brain that I send\Nthe lovers in to kill. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandson is being beaten up to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're completely at this guy's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything\Nwhile it's in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember when that poison ring\Nwas placed around my aorta long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But think, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.97,0:15:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep him away from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get as far\Naway from him as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting some distance\Nbetween me and the old man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might make my Stan's power\Nvanish without a trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but my Stan's physical\Nweakness is made up for in other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lovers may be physically weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but its range is farther\Nthan any Stan in existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how far they\Nrun, their lives are forfeit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as it remains in a host.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impolite not to look at people\Nwhen they're speaking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound like you're\Nstarting to lose your cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me around till\NGrandpa Joseph keels over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Den of steel, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for this.\NJust a matter of when.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're gonna stick around for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well help\Nmyself to your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but chump change, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I didn't expect a guy like\Nyou to be sporting a tog hoyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be borrowing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An electronics store! Mr.\NJoestar! They have TVs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does that matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think we were running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight this blasted\Nstand that's inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon Dieu, non!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have a few minutes, and we're\Ngoing to need your help to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hoped he was bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he get inside\Nmy brain so damn quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't seen it myself,\NI wouldn't have believed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.55,0:18:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least now we know for\Nsure that it's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still don't see how we're\Ngoing to destroy the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By having our stands enter Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's ear canal to find\Nand destroy the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stands are simply\Nmaterializations of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be able to shrink them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, try not to break anything\Nwhile you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going in now, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I revenge green!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be entering a blood vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A drainage ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd try to jump it, but if\NI trip and twist my ankle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it could be real bad for old man Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking all the way to that\Nbridge would be such a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lie down across this ditch and\Nmake yourself into a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just walk on you to get across.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be\Nmy bridge or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you keep yammering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said make yourself into a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good for nothing, Eric!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.31,0:19:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't look so upset, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have all day, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a rather sturdy bridge, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang, Bang, Bang, impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I think the stand is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding around the thalamus\Nmakes the most sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the point where\Nthe nervous system begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff and I will enter a blood\Nvessel from inside your inner ear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then swim through the\Nveins toward the brainstem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to do that, we need to tear the\Nwall of the blood vessel. Hey! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using your Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just slip through\Nit without cutting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this size, it's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood vessel's wall is too thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The slit will be microscopic, so there'll\Nbe no hemorrhaging to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only other issue is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutting through a blood vessel or nerve
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now will take\Nseveral minutes at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the lovers would have\Nalready done its damage by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, in all probability,\Nit may have already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping our stands this\Ntiny is really exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taking a ton of stand power\Njust to get where we can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oni vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't feel so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
