Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.77,0:23:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a very nasty itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in such a good mood\NI can hardly stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to use your\Ntongue to shine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To win in life, one must\Nthoroughly know oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.59,0:23:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spoils belong to those who\Nadmit their own weaknesses!
